{"unit_id":"UnknowCao__dsh-dock#card-zh","repo":"UnknowCao/dsh-dock","commit":"1dffd8c74f45ed28bc8f8c8956143938efacaa5f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Dock（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 Windows 上的 DSH 提供桌面一键启动与托盘控制。插件注册 launcher_install 工具，并在激活后自动安装桌面启动器；启动器可在服务已运行时直接打开界面，也可检测 DSH 安装并启动服务。主要功能包括桌面鲸鱼启动器、托盘状态与重启控制、侧栏鲸湾菜单、设置页中的托盘和开机启动选项，以及自定义 DSH 安装路径。适合希望从桌面管理本机 DSH Web 服务的 Windows 用户。需要 Windows、Node.js 和可用的 DSH 安装；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:903-947","client.js:1100-1120","candidates.mjs:133-175"]}
{"unit_id":"UnknowCao__dsh-dock#card-en","repo":"UnknowCao/dsh-dock","commit":"1dffd8c74f45ed28bc8f8c8956143938efacaa5f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Dock (DSH Web plugin) adds a Windows desktop launcher, system tray controls, and a Whale Bay sidebar menu. It starts or opens DSH, supports server restart and exit, and lets users select installed DSH paths. Requires Windows, Node.js, and DSH; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:903-947","client.js:1100-1120","candidates.mjs:133-175"]}
